  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 1a9f4185281afaf46926db1a25a2822d, type: 3}
  m_Name: juyan-arrival-2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  description: 
  isBlocking: 1
  id: 1002
  dialogList:
  - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 40b8f547de70441429ab97ee87f24d28, type: 2}
    overrideName: 
    overridePortrait: {fileID: 0}
    useBlackboardName: 0
    nameKey: 
    dialogText: The barracks are complete. Juyan finally has the semblance of a city.
      Chang, reclaiming lost territory requires more than just willpower; it depends
      on this very soil.
  - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 040104332c0706043997fff01846f372, type: 2}
    overrideName: 
    overridePortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8a72dbe276cf1e34bb4a7bd81cd2e9b9, type: 3}
    useBlackboardName: 0
    nameKey: 
    dialogText: You see things clearly, General Zheng. The essence of military farming
      is to 'farm while we fight.' Rations shipped from within the Pass are merely
      for emergencies; the harvest from this land is our true foundation in the Western
      Regions.
  - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 040104332c0706043997fff01846f372, type: 2}
    overrideName: 
    overridePortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8a72dbe276cf1e34bb4a7bd81cd2e9b9, type: 3}
    useBlackboardName: 0
    nameKey: 
    dialogText: We must build GRANARIES and expand our farmlands without delay. We
      will prove to the Xiongnu that this land is no longer their hunting ground,
      but a GRANARY securing the enduring peace of the Great Han.
